#. module: l10n_sk_invoice
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_sk_invoice.field_account_move__l10n_sk_legal_note_manual
msgid ""
"Free-text statutory note printed on the SK invoice in addition to any auto-"
"detected phrase (e.g. a specific exemption reference)."
msgstr ""
"Voľný zákonný text tlačený na slovenskej faktúre navyše k "
"automaticky zisteným formuláciám (napr. odkaz na konkrétne "
"oslobodenie)."

#. module: l10n_sk_invoice
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:l10n_sk_invoice.field_account_move__l10n_sk_legal_note_manual
msgid "Invoice Legal Note (manual)"
msgstr "Zákonná poznámka faktúry (ručne)"

#. module: l10n_sk_invoice
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_sk_invoice.field_account_move__l10n_sk_legal_notes
msgid ""
"Mandatory §74 phrases printed on the invoice — auto-detected from the taxes "
"and the customer's country, plus the manual note."
msgstr ""
"Povinné formulácie podľa § 74 tlačené na faktúre — automaticky "
"zistené z daní a krajiny odberateľa, plus ručná poznámka."

#. module: l10n_sk_invoice
#: model:ir.module.module,shortdesc:base.module_l10n_sk_invoice
msgid "SK Invoice (statutory PDF)"
msgstr "SK faktúra (zákonné PDF)"

#. module: l10n_sk_invoice
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:l10n_sk_invoice.field_account_tax__l10n_sk_reverse_charge
msgid "SK Reverse Charge (§69/12)"
msgstr "SK prenesenie daňovej povinnosti (§ 69/12)"

#. module: l10n_sk_invoice
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:l10n_sk_invoice.field_account_move__l10n_sk_legal_notes
msgid "SK Statutory Phrases"
msgstr "SK zákonné formulácie"

#. module: l10n_sk_invoice
#: model:ir.module.module,summary:base.module_l10n_sk_invoice
msgid ""
"Slovak invoice layout: DIČ/IČO/IČ DPH party block, payment symbols, "
"supply/issue/due dates and mandatory §74 statutory phrases (reverse charge, "
"exemptions). Language-driven labels."
msgstr ""
"Rozloženie slovenskej faktúry: blok strán s DIČ/IČO/IČ DPH, platobné "
"symboly, dátumy dodania/vyhotovenia/splatnosti a povinné zákonné "
"formulácie podľa § 74 (prenesenie daňovej povinnosti, oslobodenia). "
"Označenia riadené jazykom."

#. module: l10n_sk_invoice
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_sk_invoice.field_account_tax__l10n_sk_reverse_charge
msgid ""
"This tax represents a domestic reverse-charge supply (prenesenie daňovej "
"povinnosti). When used on an invoice line, the mandatory §69 ods. 12 phrase "
"is printed on the SK invoice."
msgstr ""
"Táto daň predstavuje tuzemské plnenie s prenesením daňovej "
"povinnosti. Pri použití na riadku faktúry sa na slovenskú faktúru "
"vytlačí povinná formulácia podľa § 69 ods. 12."